📝 Notes & Reflections
Key Takeaways
Networking is layered: client → DNS → IP → port → firewall → application

Always debug in order; don't skip steps

ss -lntp is your best friend for checking listening ports

curl -v shows the full HTTP conversation

dig +trace shows the full DNS resolution path

Firewalls are the most common cause of "it works locally but not remotely"
